<title>USA: Tandem Computers Q1 Dec 31 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Tandem Computers Q1 Dec 31 earnings summary.</headline>
<text>
<p>CUPERTINO, Calif., Jan 21 (Reuter)</p>
<p>		     1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.10	  profit  $0.02</p>
<p> Net  profit     11,764	 profit  1,966</p>
<p> Oper profit     13,564	 loss    15,331</p>
<p> Revs		435,732		  420,979</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  120,830		  117,452</p>
<p>	  YEAR</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Prior year amounts have been reclassified to reflect a discontinued business.</p>
<p>Income from discontinued operations for the three months ended December 31, 1995 includes a gain on sale of investments of $30.6 million. Q1 1996 EPS from continuing operations $0.10 vs loss of $0.18 in the year-ago quarter.</p>
